/**
 * A {@link MlModel} routing mechanism based on compiled {@link MlModel.Route#subjectFilter subject filter} expressions.
 * Supports routing of in-memory (not persisted) subjects and does not require explicit on-boarding of new subjects.
 *
 * This router is designed for event-based use cases, where incoming subjects may not be persisted and/or need to be
 * routed on the fly, e.g. transactions.
 *
 * **NOTE**: For best performance, user must ensure all fields that are being used in
 * {@link MlModel.Route#subjectFilter subject filter} expressions are present on the subject instance being passed to
 * {@link #models}.
 */
// TODO: PLAT-44900 Implement MlModel.RuleRoute caching mechanism
@beta
@dependency(include="this, project")
entity type MlModel.RuleRouter extends MlModel.Router type key 'RUL'
